<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <!--
      Path reachability probe, every 300 seconds: explicit HTTP proxy on :1082 versus the transparent
      fake-IP path, for both venue hosts.  Read-only and unauthenticated (/fapi/v1/ping, weight 1);
      it never writes to the venue or to any live state directory.  Evidence for the NO_PROXY
      question raised by the transport failures of 2026-09-15; see deploy/run_proxy_probe.sh for
      what the two arms do and do NOT mean.
      Cadence revised 2026-09-16 from 60s to 300s against 21h of its own data.  The 61s figure was an
      estimate made before any samples existed; the 29 outages actually recorded have a median
      duration of 138s (range 0-579s), so a 300s period samples the median event with probability
      ~0.46 and still catches on the order of 15 events per day.  The paired question the 60s cadence
      was protecting is already answered: 28 of the 29 events hit BOTH arms inside the same cluster,
      so the transparent path does NOT survive what the explicit one does not.  Cost drops from 4 to
      0.8 requests per minute at weight 1 against a 2400/min budget.
      Temporary by intent: a few days of samples, then read and remove.
      Install (operator action):
        cp deploy/com.beidou.proxy-probe.plist ~/Library/LaunchAgents/
        launchctl load -w ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.beidou.proxy-probe.plist
      Remove (operator action):
        launchctl unload -w ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.beidou.proxy-probe.plist
        rm ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.beidou.proxy-probe.plist
    -->
    <key>Label</key>
    <string>com.beidou.proxy-probe</string>
    <key>ProgramArguments</key>
    <array>
        <string>/bin/bash</string>
        <string>/Users/maguannan/beidou/deploy/run_proxy_probe.sh</string>
    </array>
    <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
    <string>/Users/maguannan/beidou</string>
    <key>StartInterval</key>
    <integer>300</integer>
    <key>RunAtLoad</key>
    <true/>
    <key>StandardOutPath</key>
    <string>/Users/maguannan/Library/Application Support/beidou/proxy-probe.stdout.log</string>
    <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
    <string>/Users/maguannan/Library/Application Support/beidou/proxy-probe.stderr.log</string>
</dict>
</plist>
